## Model

For all work in `gesh-project`, use **Grok 4.6** (CLI default) via model id **grok-4.6**
(fallback/alias **grok-4.5**).

`grok-build` and `grok-composer-2.5-fast` are RETIRED — the CLI rejects `grok-build` with
`unknown model id`. Verify current ids with `grok models` before trusting any doc, including
this one (ids rotate; this file was stale for hours after the 2026-08-21 fix landed elsewhere).

Product LLMs (Claude Sonnet/Haiku, Gemini) inside Python scripts are separate — this rule is for the IDE agent only.